{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"全忠实函子"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"全忠实函子"},0]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><strong>全忠实函子</strong> (fully faithful functor) 又称<strong>全子范畴</strong> (full subcategory), 是满足如下条件的函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$: 对任意对象 $X,Y\\in\\mathcal C$, 映射 $\\mathcal C(X,Y) \\to \\mathcal D(F(X),F(Y))$ 为等价.</p>\n"}}